# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-FJCE9`.
#
# Deliberately ONE test, and deliberately the one that contacts no server.
#
# A behavioural replay of this defect IS this defect. Under the injection the
# file's `kill-session` goes back to an unpinned tmux, and unpinned inside an
# worker can mean an ambient server the test does not own. A proof must not
# damage the thing it proves, so the replay
# asserts on the argv the file builds and spawns nothing.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --test recovery_fault_restart every_tmux_invocation_is_pinned_to_an_owned_server
